{
  "info": {
    "name": "Centrix — Colección Postman",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Importa este archivo en Postman. Configura las variables de esta colección: base_url, login y password. Envía Login > Iniciar sesión: el token se guarda automáticamente y se hereda en las peticiones protegidas. Configura usuario_id y rol_id antes de operar sobre usuarios. Las carpetas organizan los módulos y aquí se añadirán los siguientes endpoints.\n\nNo hay credenciales predeterminadas. Usa una cuenta con contraseña establecida. Crear usuarios y reenviar enlaces requieren correo y CENTRIX_PASSWORD_URL configurados. Para recuperación utiliza reset_token (el del enlace de correo, distinto del Bearer) y nueva_password. La contraseña nueva debe tener mínimo 12 caracteres, mayúsculas, minúsculas, números y símbolos; con bcrypt, máximo 72 bytes.\n\nLa URL de ejemplo es para desarrollo local. En producción utiliza HTTPS. Si aún no se aplicó el esquema, la API responde 503. Roles y módulos tienen endpoints de consulta; la bitácora se registra automáticamente. Las peticiones son independientes: eliminar realiza borrado físico y no se recomienda ejecutar toda la colección en secuencia. Mantén las credenciales y tokens reales como valores locales en Postman y no los compartas al exportar."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "login",
      "value": "admin",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuario_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "rol_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "email_recuperacion",
      "value": "admin@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "reset_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "nueva_password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuario_login",
      "value": "jperez",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuario_email",
      "value": "jperez@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuario_email_nuevo",
      "value": "jperez.nuevo@example.com",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Iniciar sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"{{login}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.dataResponse && typeof body.dataResponse.token === 'string' && body.dataResponse.token.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.dataResponse.token);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar mi sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "me"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cerrar sesión",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logout"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.unset('token');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Solicitar recuperación de contraseña",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/forgot-password",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "forgot-password"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email_recuperacion}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Establecer contraseña",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/reset-password",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reset-password"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email_recuperacion}}\",\n  \"token\": \"{{reset_token}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{nueva_password}}\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"{{nueva_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
